            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is not an LSP issue. This is a syntax issue. Neovim uses regular expression syntax inherited from vim to get the highlights.\n\nAvoid adding tags if you're not 100% confident about them. Also, please include the actual code snippet pasted in so I don't have to OCR the image and manually type it out.\n\nI was able to reproduce the issue - I'm filing this upstream with vim.",
