            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "the code:\n\n```\nint main( void )\n{\n    typedef float vec   __attribute__( (__ext_vector_type__(4)) );\n\n    typedef struct\n    {\n        int a;\n        vec b;\n    } Foo;\n\n    Foo foo1 = (Foo){ .a=1, .b = {0.0f} };\n\n#define CREATE(...) (Foo){ __VA_ARGS__ }\n    Foo foo2 = CREATE( .a=1, .b={0.0f}); \n\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\nI was thinking the syntax highlight was done using the LSP not a simple regular expression.",
